	(text "CASE OF REGULATOR, LM323, AND HEAT\nSINK TABS OF REMAINING THREE REGULATORS\nARE ALL AT DIFFERENT ELECTRICAL POTENTIALS.\n\nCAUTION SHOULD BE EXERCISED TO INSURE\nAGAINST DIRECT ELECTRICAL CONTACT BETWEEN\nTHESE POINTS. THEY MUST NOT BE SHORTED\nTOGETHER, NOR TO THE HEATSINK OF THE LM323."
